{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game integrates exploration, management, and third-person combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players assume the role of Coco, Cinnamon\u2019s younger sister, who sets out on a journey to find her missing sibling. Along the way, Coco must manage a food truck to earn travel expenses and enhance her abilities. Throughout her adventure, she will meet a diverse range of new friends, assist residents in various regions, and ultimately uncover the truth behind a mysterious disaster while reuniting with her sister Cinnamon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Characters</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981910/extras/3d017fb2131b19f56dab7bcd5af544ae.avif?t=1757390143\" width=451 height=372 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The elf Coco and the great detective Catpie are on a mission to find their missing sister,  Cinnamon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Run Your Food Truck</strong><br>Fulfill customer orders to earn money, hire a variety of employees, and discover unique tricks to make your business thrive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Develop Dishes</strong><br>Create delicious new foods to attract guests with unique tastes. Pack these new dishes in your lunchbox to grow stronger and more powerful!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat</strong><br>Attack, dodge! Defend, charge! You can even try offering food to your enemies\u2014maybe they\u2019ll become friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration</strong><br>Investigate wondrous locations, uncover clues, and reveal the truth behind Cinnamon\u2019s disappearance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sanity</strong><br>Manage your sanity carefully. When you lose it, you\u2019ll see the other side of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Friends</strong><br>Recruit companions to join you on your journey toward truth and discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And so much more! Wishlist and follow now!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3981910?t=1757390143","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3981910?t=1757390143","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981910/a57a56528a7a95844214a9fa446e374891421767/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757390143","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981910/a57a56528a7a95844214a9fa446e374891421767/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757390143","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game integrates exploration, management, and third-person combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players assume the role of Coco, Cinnamon\u2019s younger sister, who sets out on a journey to find her missing sibling. Along the way, Coco must manage a food truck to earn travel expenses and enhance her abilities. Throughout her adventure, she will meet a diverse range of new friends, assist residents in various regions, and ultimately uncover the truth behind a mysterious disaster while reuniting with her sister Cinnamon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Characters</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981910/extras/3d017fb2131b19f56dab7bcd5af544ae.avif?t=1757390143\" width=451 height=372 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The elf Coco and the great detective Catpie are on a mission to find their missing sister,  Cinnamon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Run Your Food Truck</strong><br>Fulfill customer orders to earn money, hire a variet